{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"spades-game UI copy.fields.rulesText","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"spades-game.copy.fields.rulesText","keys":["spades-game.copy.fields.rulesText"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Deck kad piawai ZXQPH0000QXZ diberikan secara sama rata. Setiap pemain menawar trik ZXQPH0001QXZ–ZXQPH0002QXZ; tawar nol yang berjaya memperoleh ZXQPH0003QXZ dan gagal memperoleh ZXQPH0004QXZ. Kontrak pasukan menambahkan tawar bukan-nol mereka: buat jumlah untuk ZXQPH0005QXZ mata setiap tawar, ditambah satu beg untuk setiap trik tambahan; terlepas dan kehilangan ZXQPH0006QXZ mata setiap tawar. Setiap sepuluh beg yang terkumpul kurangkan ZXQPH0007QXZ mata. Pemain mesti ikut warna yang dipimpin bila mungkin. Spade tidak boleh dipimpin sehingga pecah melainkan pemain hanya memegang spade, dan spade mengalahkan mana-mana kad bukan spade.","record_id":"7ca56a11878e1f67cdfdb15ef1f40e9ed14b16161572503483238d0fd069d8d2","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":4.400376221750037,"source":"The standard 52-card deck is dealt evenly. Each player bids 0–13 tricks; a successful nil bid scores 100 and a failed nil loses 100. Team contracts add their non-nil bids: make the total for 10 points per bid, plus one bag for each extra trick; miss it and lose 10 points per bid. Every ten accumulated bags subtract 100 points. Players must follow the suit led when possible. Spades cannot be led until broken unless a player holds only spades, and a spade beats any non-spade card.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"b070b3bdbe8ea9a514fbc13b545bd851619f9a66b846fe5b4b157ec211a4c86c","status":"needs-review","translation":"Deck kad piawai 52 diberikan secara sama rata. Setiap pemain menawar trik 0–13; tawar nol yang berjaya memperoleh 100 dan gagal memperoleh 100. Kontrak pasukan menambahkan tawar bukan-nol mereka: buat jumlah untuk 10 mata setiap tawar, ditambah satu beg untuk setiap trik tambahan; terlepas dan kehilangan 10 mata setiap tawar. Setiap sepuluh beg yang terkumpul kurangkan 100 mata. Pemain mesti ikut warna yang dipimpin bila mungkin. Spade tidak boleh dipimpin sehingga pecah melainkan pemain hanya memegang spade, dan spade mengalahkan mana-mana kad bukan spade.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
